Description: VeltOS desktop experience for KDE Plasma
 System-wide defaults that turn a stock KDE Plasma 6 session into the VeltOS
 desktop:
  * "VeltOS Dark" (default) and "VeltOS Light" global themes with a
    centered, Windows 11 style taskbar layout for new users;
  * VeltOS colour schemes derived from KDE Breeze;
  * the "Velt Bloom" wallpaper (light and dark variants), login splash,
    lock screen and SDDM login background;
  * the VeltOS logo, used for the application launcher button.
 .
 Existing users' Plasma configuration is not modified.
